---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="mt-24 bg-pine-950 text-pine-100/70">
  <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-6xl gap-10 px-4 py-14 sm:px-6 md:grid-cols-[1.4fr_1fr_1fr]">
    <div>
      <a href="/" class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
        <img src="/logo-parktracker.png" alt="" class="h-8 w-8" />
        <span class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-paper-50">ParkTracker</span>
      </a>
      <p class="mt-4 max-w-sm text-sm leading-relaxed">
        Explorar la naturaleza es un privilegio; protegerla, una responsabilidad. Trabajo Fin de Grado de la Universidad de Granada.
      </p>
    </div>

    <nav aria-label="Pie de página">
      <p class="mb-4 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-pine-300">Explora</p>
      <ul class="space-y-2.5 text-sm">
        <li><a href="/map" class="transition hover:text-paper-50">Comprueba tu ruta</a></li>
        <li><a href="/createTrack" class="transition hover:text-paper-50">Crea tu ruta</a></li>
        <li><a href="/naturalParks" class="transition hover:text-paper-50">Parques naturales</a></li>
      </ul>
    </nav>

    <div>
      <p class="mb-4 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-pine-300">Proyecto</p>
      <ul class="space-y-2.5 text-sm">
        <li><a href="/about" class="transition hover:text-paper-50">Sobre nosotros</a></li>
        <li><a href="/contact" class="transition hover:text-paper-50">Contacto</a></li>
        <li><a href="/privacypolicy" class="transition hover:text-paper-50">Política de privacidad</a></li>
        <li><a href="mailto:parktracker.contact@gmail.com" class="transition hover:text-paper-50">parktracker.contact@gmail.com</a></li>
        <li>
          <a href="https://github.com/albertocmr/ParkTracker" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 transition hover:text-paper-50" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
            <svg width="18" height="18" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
              <path
                fill-rule="evenodd"
                d="M12 2C6.477 2 2 6.484 2 12.017c0 4.425 2.865 8.18 6.839 9.504.5.092.682-.217.682-.483 0-.237-.008-.868-.013-1.703-2.782.605-3.369-1.343-3.369-1.343-.454-1.158-1.11-1.466-1.11-1.466-.908-.62.069-.608.069-.608 1.003.07 1.531 1.032 1.531 1.032.892 1.53 2.341 1.088 2.91.832.092-.647.35-1.088.636-1.338-2.22-.253-4.555-1.113-4.555-4.951 0-1.093.39-1.988 1.029-2.688-.103-.253-.446-1.272.098-2.65 0 0 .84-.27 2.75 1.026A9.564 9.564 0 0112 6.844c.85.004 1.705.115 2.504.337 1.909-1.296 2.747-1.027 2.747-1.027.546 1.379.202 2.398.1 2.651.64.7 1.028 1.595 1.028 2.688 0 3.848-2.339 4.695-4.566 4.943.359.309.678.92.678 1.855 0 1.338-.012 2.419-.012 2.747 0 .268.18.58.688.482A10.019 10.019 0 0022 12.017C22 6.484 17.522 2 12 2z"
                clip-rule="evenodd"></path>
            </svg>
            Código en GitHub
          </a>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="border-t border-white/5">
    <div class="mx-auto flex max-w-6xl flex-col gap-2 px-4 py-6 text-xs text-pine-100/45 sm:flex-row sm:justify-between sm:px-6">
      <p>© {year} Alberto Cámara · Universidad de Granada</p>
      <p>Mapas © colaboradores de OpenStreetMap</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
